msgid ""
"Built on the Chromium Embedded Framework. Karere 4.0 replaces the WebKitGTK "
"backend with the Chromium Embedded Framework, bringing full video attachment "
"playback (H.264/AAC), multi-account support with isolated sessions, per-"
"account zoom, and a faster, more compatible rendering engine while keeping "
"the same native GTK4/libadwaita shell."
msgstr ""
"Nú bygt á CEF/Chromium 148. Karere 4.0 skiftir WebKitGTK-bakgrundin út við "
"Chromium Embedded Framework, sum førir fulla videoávísingar-spæling (H.264/"
"AAC), fleirkonto-stuðul við avbyrgdum setum, kontu-serliga stødd, og eina "
"skjótari, meiri sambæriliga teknimynd, samstundis sum sama innfødda GTK4/"
"libadwaita skelið verður varðveitt."

